{"title":"1980 IMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>In 1980, due to political sanctions resulting from the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan, there was no <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a>.  Many other international events, such as the Olympic Games, were also cancelled.  However, a number of smaller replacement IMOs were held.  These included the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Austria-Poland_Olympiad&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Austria-Poland Olympiad (page does not exist)\">Austria-Poland Olympiad</a> (which occurred annually anyway, having been established two years earlier), and the replacement olympiads in Mersch, Luxembourg; and Mariehamn, Finland.  The olympiad at Mersch was attended by Belgium, Great Britain, the Netherlands, and Yugoslavia; in addition, France sent a team of four observers.  The olympiad at Mariehamn was attended by Great Britain, Hungary, and Sweden.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Replacement_IMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 Replacement IMO Problems (page does not exist)\">1980 Replacement IMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_Replacement_IMO_Shortlist_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 Replacement IMO Shortlist Problems (page does not exist)\">1980 Replacement IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\"> IMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Shortlist_Problems\" title=\"IMO Shortlist Problems\">IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li></ul>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1980 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_IMO\" title=\"1979 IMO\">1979 IMO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1980 IMO Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;act